    "notes": "Bambu Studio process profile for the H2C with a 0.2mm hardened nozzle, tuned specifically for PPS-CF and PPS-GF filaments. Verified pairing: Bambu Studio Generic PPS-CF filament preset driving Fiberon PPS-GF filament. Engineering-grade defaults: 4 walls, 7 top / 6 bottom shells, 20% grid infill, conservative ~1.6 mm^3/s peak flow. PPS-specific choices: 0.12mm initial layer + 0.28mm initial line width + 8mm outer-and-inner brim for warp control; minimal retraction (0.6mm) and 0.2mm Z-hop because PPS-CF/GF barely ooze and abrasive retracts wear the nozzle; bridge flow 0.80 and bridge speed 20 since PPS sags more than nylons; no ironing because fiber smears. If the part fan is off (filament preset should disable it), expect mild ringing at corners — drop outer-wall accel to 1000 if visible."
